Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 23:00:00 +0330
Subject: [PATCH 09/18] feat: product name from APP_NAME, no Outline links, right-click only on documents, no Welcome collection
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

VERSION: 2.1 (2026-10-12)  2.0 = merged set of 11 patches; 2.1 = APP_NAME read from the environment
Root: build/outline-1.11.0 (apply after 0001..0008)

Menu without Outline links, right-click only on documents (was 0015 v1.1):
- The account menu and the command bar no longer offer Documentation, API
  documentation, Changelog, Send us feedback and Report a bug (links to
  getoutline.com and GitHub).
- Right-click: the document menu (0006) and the existing list menus stay;
  elsewhere the browser menu is not shown either. Text fields and editors
  keep it; Shift+right-click still opens it.

Product name (2.1):
- APP_NAME from the environment (config/outline.env, asked in install.sh
  step 9) is the product name in titles and e-mails and the name of a new
  workspace on first sign-in. Upstream defined the variable but always used
  "Outline".

No Welcome collection (was 0017 v1.0):
- A new workspace starts empty, without the "Welcome" collection and its
  four onboarding documents. An existing one is not touched.

Files (5; N = new, M = modified, D = deleted):
  M app/actions/definitions/navigation.tsx
  M app/components/AuthenticatedLayout.tsx
  M app/menus/AccountMenu.tsx
  M server/commands/accountProvisioner.ts
  M server/env.ts

---
---

